  "item_short_desc": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s Workout Performance Leggings for women offer a blend of style and functionality. Made from a polyester/spandex material blend, the leggings ensure flexibility during workouts. Featuring convenient pockets on both thighs and a hidden pocket in the waistband, the womens leggings provide ample storage for essentials. The quick-dry fabric wicks moisture away, keeping you cool and dry during high-intensity activities like yoga or running. These leggings are designed for comfort, whether you're working out or lounging.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "132919",
  "description": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s Workout Performance Leggings for women offer a blend of style and functionality. Made from a polyester/spandex material blend, the leggings ensure flexibility during workouts. Featuring convenient pockets on both thighs and a hidden pocket in the waistband, the womens leggings provide ample storage for essentials. The quick-dry fabric wicks moisture away, keeping you cool and dry during high-intensity activities like yoga or running. These leggings are designed for comfort, whether you're working out or lounging, and their 7/8 length adds a trendy touch. Rothco stands out as the leader in camouflage clothing and accessories. With a rich heritage spanning over 7 decades, we have honed our expertise in crafting durable and effective camouflage gear. Our extensive range of products, including apparel, bags, and gear, showcases a diverse selection of camouflage, with over 35 patterns available! From outdoor enthusiasts and active-duty personnel, to skate and fashion, Rothco is the go-to brand for camo.</p>",
